{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1794840448","published":"2026-11-16T14:47:40Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:17:15.181521776Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-106565","CVE-2026-109264","CVE-2026-116149","CVE-2026-116157"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-106565, CVE-2026-109264, CVE-2026-116149, CVE-2026-116157","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: infinite loop at the end of a bzip2-compressed blob\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-106565.patch: set the end-of-file flag when a\n       bzip2 read returns less than requested without an error in ReadBlob(),\n       and keep it set in EOFBlob() in magick/blob.c\n     - CVE-2026-106565\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: reads continue on a bzip2 stream after a read error\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-116149.patch: set the blob status on a bzip2\n       read error and stop reading once it is set in ReadBlob() in\n       magick/blob.c\n     - CVE-2026-116149\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: memory leaks in PerlMagick\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-116157.patch: free the strings returned by\n       InterpretImageProperties() in PerlMagick/Magick.xs and\n       PerlMagick/quantum/quantum.xs.in\n     - CVE-2026-116157\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: unbounded nesting of image reads from SVG and MVG\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-109264.patch: limit the nesting depth of\n       image reads with a coder_depth field in ImageInfo in magick/image.c,\n       magick/image.h and magick/image-private.h, and read the SVG image\n       element and the MVG image primitive through StrictReadImage(), which\n       refuses explicit coder prefixes other than mpr: and mpri:, in\n       coders/svg.c, magick/draw.c and magick/constitute-private.h\n     - CVE-2026-109264","affected":[{"package":{"name":"imagemagick","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:16.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/imagemagick?distro=ubuntu-16.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8:6.8.9.9-7ubuntu5.17+tuxcare.els70"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcar